        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram Tong Hop - Quan ly Khuyen mai\n\nautonumber\nactor \&quot;Quan ly\&quot; as QL\nboundary \&quot;Giao dien KM\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Khuyen mai Controller\&quot; as Ctrl\nentity \&quot;Chuong trinh KM\&quot; as KMEntity\nentity \&quot;Ma giam gia (Voucher)\&quot; as VoucherEntity\nentity \&quot;Hoa don &amp; Giao dich\&quot; as HDEntity\n\nactivate QL\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; GROUP 1: QUAN LY CHUONG TRINH KM (UC 1, 2, 3, 4, 5)\n&#39; ==========================================\ngroup 1. Quan ly Chuong trinh Khuyen mai\n    \n    &#39; UC 1: Tra cứu chương trình Khuyến mãi\n    QL -&gt; UI: Chon \&quot;Danh sach Khuyen mai\&quot; &amp; Nhap tieu chi loc\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl: traCuuKhuyenMai(tieuChi)\n    activate Ctrl\n    Ctrl -&gt; KMEntity: getDanhSachKM(tieuChi)\n    activate KMEntity\n    \n    alt Chua co du lieu\n        KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve rong\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi \&quot;Chua co du lieu\&quot; &amp; Nut \&quot;Tao moi ngay\&quot;\n    else Co du lieu\n        KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve danh sach KM\n        deactivate KMEntity\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi danh sach KM\n    end\n    deactivate Ctrl\n\n    &#39; UC 2, 3 &amp; 5: Thêm mới / Chỉnh sửa &amp; Validate dữ liệu\n    opt Them moi / Chinh sua chuong trinh KM\n        QL -&gt; UI: Nhap thong tin KM (Thoi gian, muc giam, pham vi) &amp; Nhan \&quot;Luu\&quot;\n        UI -&gt; Ctrl: thietLapKhuyenMai(thongTinKM)\n        activate Ctrl\n\n        &#39; UC 5: Kiểm tra dữ liệu KM (Sub-usecase)\n        Ctrl -&gt; Ctrl: validateQuyTac(ten, mucGiam, thoiGian)\n        \n        alt Loi thoi gian / Muc giam\n            Ctrl --&gt; UI: Bao loi thoi gian hoac muc giam khong hop le\n        else Du lieu co ban hop le\n            Ctrl -&gt; KMEntity: checkXungDotSanPham(thongTinKM)\n            activate KMEntity\n            \n            alt Trung lap khuyen mai\n                KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Phat hien xung dot san pham\n                Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi canh bao \&quot;San pham dang trung khuyen mai\&quot;\n            else Hoan toan hop le\n                KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Khong xung dot\n                Ctrl -&gt; KMEntity: saveKhuyenMai(thongTinKM)\n                KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Luu thanh cong\n                deactivate KMEntity\n                Ctrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao thanh cong &amp; Cap nhat danh sach\n            end\n        end\n        deactivate Ctrl\n    end\n\n    &#39; UC 4: Hủy / Ngừng chương trình KM\n    opt Huy / Ngung chuong trinh KM\n        QL -&gt; UI: Nhan \&quot;Huy / Ngung\&quot; tai chuong trinh dang dien ra\n        UI --&gt; QL: Hien thi hop thoai xac nhan ngung\n        QL -&gt; UI: Bam \&quot;Dong y\&quot;\n        \n        UI -&gt; Ctrl: ngungKhuyenMai(maKM)\n        activate Ctrl\n        Ctrl -&gt; KMEntity: updateTrangThai(maKM, \&quot;Da ngung\&quot;)\n        activate KMEntity\n        KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Cap nhat thanh cong\n        deactivate KMEntity\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao thanh cong &amp; Lam moi danh sach\n        deactivate Ctrl\n    end\nend\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; GROUP 2: QUAN LY MA GIAM GIA / VOUCHER (UC 6, 7)\n&#39; ==========================================\ngroup 2. Quan ly Ma giam gia (Voucher)\n    \n    &#39; UC 6: Tạo và Quản lý mã giảm giá\n    opt Tao ma giam gia moi\n        QL -&gt; UI: Nhap chuoi ma, dieu kien, han su dung &amp; Nhan \&quot;Luu\&quot;\n        UI -&gt; Ctrl: phatHanhVoucher(thongTinVoucher)\n        activate Ctrl\n        Ctrl -&gt; VoucherEntity: checkTonTaiMa(chuoiMa)\n        activate VoucherEntity\n        \n        alt Ma da ton tai\n            VoucherEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Phat hien trung lap\n            Ctrl --&gt; UI: Bao loi \&quot;Ma voucher da ton tai, vui long nhap ma khac\&quot;\n        else Ma hop le\n            VoucherEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Ma chua duoc su dung\n            Ctrl -&gt; VoucherEntity: saveVoucher(thongTinVoucher)\n            VoucherEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Luu thanh cong\n            deactivate VoucherEntity\n            Ctrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao phat hanh thanh cong\n        end\n        deactivate Ctrl\n    end\n\n    &#39; UC 7: Tra cứu lịch sử sử dụng mã\n    opt Tra cuu lich su su dung ma\n        QL -&gt; UI: Click \&quot;Xem lich su\&quot; tai mot ma voucher\n        UI -&gt; Ctrl: getLichSuSuDung(maVoucher)\n        activate Ctrl\n        Ctrl -&gt; HDEntity: queryGiaoDichByVoucher(maVoucher)\n        activate HDEntity\n        \n        alt Chua co nguoi dung\n            HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve danh sach rong\n            Ctrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao \&quot;Ma chua duoc su dung lan nao\&quot;\n        else Co nguoi dung\n            HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve danh sach hoa don lien quan\n            deactivate HDEntity\n            Ctrl -&gt; Ctrl: Tong hop thong tin (Ma HD, Ten KH, Ngay dung, So tien)\n            Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi bang danh sach lich su chi tiet\n        end\n        deactivate Ctrl\n    end\nend\n\ndeactivate UI\ndeactivate QL\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ftcKk-B_wvgF5jlqzV83-1">
